1
00:06:03,529 --> 00:06:09,529
A man in search. A woman in need. A story of fate.

2
00:12:07,058 --> 00:12:13,058
A Walk in the Clouds is a drama, romance film directed by Alfonso Arau.

3
00:18:10,588 --> 00:18:16,588
World War II vet Paul Sutton falls for a pregnant and unwed woman who persuades him -- during
their first encounter -- to pose as her husband so she can face her family.

4
00:24:14,117 --> 00:24:20,117
Paul Sutton, played by Keanu Reeves.

5
00:30:17,647 --> 00:30:23,647
Victoria Aragón, played by Aitana Sánchez-Gijón.

6
00:36:21,176 --> 00:36:27,176
Don Pedro Aragón, played by Anthony Quinn.

7
00:42:24,705 --> 00:42:30,705
María José Aragón, played by Angélica Aragón.

8
00:48:28,235 --> 00:48:34,235
Guadelupe Aragón, played by Evangelina Elizondo.

9
00:54:31,764 --> 00:54:37,764
Betty Sutton, played by Debra Messing.

10
01:00:35,294 --> 01:00:41,294
A Walk in the Clouds is a 1995 period romantic drama film directed by Alfonso Arau and starring Keanu Reeves, Aitana
Sánchez-Gijón, Giancarlo Giannini, Angélica Aragón, Evangelina Elizondo, Debra Messing and Anthony Quinn.

11
01:06:38,823 --> 01:06:44,823
An international co-production film between the United States and Mexico, it was an
English-language remake of the 1942 Italian film Four Steps in the Clouds.

12
01:12:42,352 --> 01:12:48,352
A Walk in the Clouds was released in theaters on
August 11, 1995, by 20th Century Fox.

13
01:18:45,882 --> 01:18:51,882
It received mixed reviews from critics, but it was a commercial
success, grossing $91 million against a $20 million budget.

14
01:24:49,411 --> 01:24:55,411
Maurice Jarre’s musical score earned him a Golden
Globe Award for Best Original Score.

15
01:30:52,941 --> 01:30:58,941
The film explores themes of pregnancy, world war ii, vineyard, love, remake.

16
01:36:56,470 --> 01:37:02,470
The tone is emotional.
